loqui is a Rust rewrite of the core of open-speech: the
OpenAI-compatible speech and transcription endpoints, backed by Kokoro and
Whisper. The design, wire contract and several behaviours (voice blending,
silence trimming, model-switch rollback) are ported from:

  open-speech — https://github.com/jeremy-windsor/open-speech
  Copyright (c) 2026 Jeremy Windsor. MIT License.

Third-party material embedded in, or downloaded by, this software:

  Kokoro-82M model weights and voice packs — https://huggingface.co/hexgrad/Kokoro-82M
  ONNX export: https://huggingface.co/onnx-community/Kokoro-82M-v1.0-ONNX
  Apache License 2.0. Downloaded at runtime; not redistributed in this repository.

  misaki G2P lexicons, version 0.9.4 (us/gb gold and silver) — https://github.com/hexgrad/misaki
  Apache License 2.0; copy at crates/loqui-g2p/data/LICENSE-misaki-Apache-2.0.
  Embedded unmodified in crates/loqui-g2p/data/misaki-*.json.

  misaki English G2P logic (misaki/en.py, version 0.9.4) — https://github.com/hexgrad/misaki
  Apache License 2.0. Ported to Rust in crates/loqui-g2p/src/en.rs.

  spaCy English tokenizer rules (spaCy 3.8.16) — https://github.com/explosion/spaCy
  Copyright (c) 2016-2026 ExplosionAI GmbH, 2016 spaCy GmbH, 2015 Matthew Honnibal.
  MIT License. Exported as data to crates/loqui-g2p/data/spacy-en-tokenizer.json;
  the tokenizer algorithm is reimplemented in crates/loqui-g2p/src/tokenize.rs.

  POS tagger weights (crates/loqui-g2p/data/tagger-en.bin) are original to
  loqui: an averaged perceptron trained on public-domain Project Gutenberg
  text and generated sentences, labelled by spaCy's MIT-licensed
  en_core_web_sm 3.8.0. See tools/parity/README.md to reproduce them.

  English grapheme-to-phoneme models, embedded unmodified:
    crates/loqui-g2p/data/g2p-en-us.safetensors
      https://huggingface.co/PeterReid/graphemes_to_phonemes_en_us
      (revision a5631b285d18d59483c32c0c3379cb9fac924f4b)
    crates/loqui-g2p/data/g2p-en-gb.safetensors
      https://huggingface.co/PeterReid/graphemes_to_phonemes_en_gb
      (revision d8357d5067fa26a5c34134d6bbcf4bbf000c0ac8)
  Apache License 2.0. BART models trained on the misaki lexicons.

  Whisper model weights (GGML) — https://huggingface.co/ggerganov/whisper.cpp
  MIT License (OpenAI Whisper). Downloaded at runtime, pinned to a commit
  revision and SHA-256; not redistributed.

  WeSpeaker ResNet34-LM speaker-embedding weights, trained on VoxCeleb —
  https://github.com/wenet-e2e/wespeaker (pretrained models,
  docs/pretrained.md). ONNX export by sherpa-onnx:
  https://huggingface.co/csukuangfj/speaker-embedding-models
  (wespeaker_en_voxceleb_resnet34_LM.onnx, revision
  0743f301363dec56491a490f6d6cbc9d67f9a3bf).
  Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC-BY-4.0), the licence of
  the VoxCeleb dataset. Downloaded at runtime, pinned to a commit revision and
  SHA-256; not redistributed.

  The Kaldi log mel filterbank (crates/loqui-speaker/src/fbank.rs) is
  reimplemented from the algorithm Kaldi documents and kaldi-native-fbank
  implements (Apache License 2.0); no source is copied.

