Optional, off-by-default LGPL component:

  LAME 3.100 — https://lame.sourceforge.io
  LGPL-2.0-or-later, through the mp3lame-encoder and mp3lame-sys crates
  (LGPL-3.0). Compiled from source and linked statically only when the `mp3`
  feature is enabled. A default build contains no LAME code. A binary built
  with `mp3` must let its users relink it against a modified LAME; running
  `loqui serve` as a separate process keeps that obligation away from its
  clients.

No GPL code is linked. Where upstream misaki calls eSpeak NG (GPL-3.0) for
unknown words, loqui-g2p uses its own embedded neural model instead.
